# CODEOWNERS — ownership map for the layered codebase.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ⚠️  PLACEHOLDER OWNERS. The @fyraliscore/* team slugs below do NOT exist yet.
#     Replace them with real GitHub teams/users BEFORE enabling branch
#     protection's "Require review from Code Owners" — otherwise PRs will be
#     un-mergeable (no resolvable owner). Until then this file is documentation
#     of intended ownership and is safe (CODEOWNERS only enforces when branch
#     protection opts in).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Ownership follows the architectural layers (see CODEBASE-ARCHITECTURE.md).
# Last matching pattern wins, so the specific layer rules below override the
# repo-wide default.

# Repo-wide default
*                               @fyraliscore/maintainers

# Shared libraries & schema (highest blast radius — review carefully)
/lib/                           @fyraliscore/platform-team
/db/                            @fyraliscore/platform-team
/pyproject.toml                 @fyraliscore/platform-team
/.importlinter                  @fyraliscore/platform-team

# Service layers
/services/app/                  @fyraliscore/app-team
/services/product/              @fyraliscore/product-team
/services/reasoning/            @fyraliscore/reasoning-team
/services/ingest/               @fyraliscore/ingest-team
/services/domain/               @fyraliscore/domain-team
/services/platform/             @fyraliscore/platform-team
/services/workers/              @fyraliscore/platform-team

# Frontend
/ui/                            @fyraliscore/frontend-team

# CI / infra / ops
/.github/                       @fyraliscore/platform-team
/docker-compose*.yml            @fyraliscore/platform-team
/Dockerfile*                    @fyraliscore/platform-team
/scripts/                       @fyraliscore/platform-team

# Docs
/docs/                          @fyraliscore/maintainers
/CODEBASE-ARCHITECTURE.md       @fyraliscore/maintainers
/CODEBASE-MANAGEMENT.md         @fyraliscore/maintainers
